<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets call warrants on zinc. [CORRECTED 12:05 GMT]</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets call warrants on zinc. [CORRECTED 12:05 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International says it has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on zinc.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one tenth of one metric tonne of zinc.</p>
<p> WARRANTS    STRIKE	ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	$1,100.00   $9.30	  10.98 PCT    11.56 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	$1,250.00   $4.00	  20.00 PCT    26.88 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 29.JAN.97-28.JAN.98   PAYDATE	29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>(Corrects strike price for the tranche B warrants from $1,075 to $1,250)</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
